{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14771","headline":"东潭宴饯河南赵少府 · 卢纶","name":"东潭宴饯河南赵少府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"十载奉戎轩，日闻君子言。\n方将贺荣爵，遽乃怆离尊。\n岸转台阁丽，潭清弦管繁。\n松篁难晦节，雨露不私恩。\n坐使吏相勉，居爲儒所尊。\n可怜桃李树，先发信陵门。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"卢纶","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_14771.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_14771","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}